  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a non-stick skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add onions and garlic; sauté for about 5 minutes until softened.",
    "Stir in red pepper flakes, salt, and black pepper. Cook for an additional minute.",
    "Pour in the water or vegetable broth, then stir in English mustard.",
    "Reduce to a simmer and cook for another 10-15 minutes until the onions are tender and the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "Serve hot as a side dish with pita bread."
